\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cf1 Vigram has been seduced by the prospect of Power by Pel.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cf1 He believes that he is going to dominate the world once he is given control of a great weapon - the Mazid. The Mazid is a person who can shoot fire out of their mouth, and will be dominated by Vigram\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92s will. Vigram is looking for a person to fill this role.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cf1 He believes Mandri may be this person.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cf1 However, Pel is the one who will make that determination.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
