\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Vigram has been seduced by the prospect of Power by Pel.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 He believes that he is going to dominate the world once he is given control of a great weapon - the Mazid. The Mazid is a person who can shoot fire out of their mouth, and will be dominated by Vigram\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s will. Vigram is looking for a person to fill this role.}
